        <profile name="Redden the earth" id="0bed-5b0a-4230-10f6" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to Advance rolls and charge rolls made for units with this tactic.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="445b-f13f-335b-7c12" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Total adherence to the Codex Astartes" id="70a0-554f-4924-e5c9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When using any models with this tactic:
- In your first battle round, only the Devastator Doctrine can be selected.
- In your second and third battle round, only the Tactical Doctrine can be selected.
- From your fourth battle round, only the Assault Doctrine can be selected.
Whilst the Tactical Doctrine is active, models with this tactic consider the Devastator Doctrine to be active as well.
Whilst the Assault Doctrine is active, models with this tactic consider the Tactical Doctrine to be active as well.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="4481-3ff4-559e-7def" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The bond martial" id="3717-8096-3e01-1dc1" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack against an INFANTRY or BIKER unit, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.
- Each time a unit with this tactic is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="1f1e-85f5-7d9a-62ff" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tome tactics" id="2ebb-59d1-229a-9735" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a ranged attack with a bolt weapon, re-roll a hit roll of 1.
- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this tactic, it is automatically passed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="7a95-83e0-5cc9-85a4" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lightning deployment" id="5cce-40bb-a497-e2f9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- All TRANSPORT units of the CARCHARODONS receive the ASSAULT TRANSPORT keyword.
- Add 2 to movement or charge rolls if the unit has dissembarked from a TRANSPORT or deployed as Reinforcements in the previous Movement phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="532d-0d0a-60bd-f226" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Surgical strikes" id="4293-89f2-4c79-356d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an attack made by a model with this tactic against a CHARACTER unit, you can add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="4141-2c38-e535-8f37" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="No matter the odds" id="4182-d65b-6044-c7ec" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by this unit that target an enemy unit that contains at least twice as many models as their own. For the purposes of this ability, CRIMSON FISTS VEHICLE units from your army count as 5 other models.
- All units with this ability gain Objective Secured ability as described in 9th edition Core Rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="9968-5d45-5101-9a86" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Legacy of Dorn" id="f175-3d6c-b51b-22d1" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Devastator Doctrine is active, each time a model with this ability makes an attack with a Heavy weapon against a MONSTER, VEHICLE, TITANIC or BUILDING unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="9968-5d45-5101-9a86" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="55b9-4b5d-3151-41d7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="58f3-4dd1-413a-19bb" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="8984-fb64-ce9e-42fe" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="By my will I deny Thee" id="49c9-4e7d-1f45-89c3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack is made against a unit with this tactic, an unmodified wound roll of 1 or 2 always fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the attacker may have.
- Each time a model with this tactic would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- All INFANTRY units with this ability gain Objective Secured ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="8984-fb64-ce9e-42fe" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Siege masters" id="5ae1-73c5-6fc3-dfbf" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a ranged attack, the target does not recieve the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes attack with a bolt weapon, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="58f3-4dd1-413a-19bb" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="55b9-4b5d-3151-41d7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grim resolve" id="2761-72bd-7c60-6e24" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes an attack, if that models unit has remained stationary in the previous movement phase, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll, and you can ignore any or all modifiers to the Hit roll.
- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this tactic, it is automatically passed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="f657-aa75-dcf2-df44" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Inner Circle" id="f397-7419-a8a9-66fe" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a Morale test is taken for a unit with this tactic, it is automatically passed.
- Each time you select a unit with this tactic to Fall Back, unless it has the VEHICLE, RAVENWING or CHAPTER MASTER keywords, roll 2D6: if the result is less than or equal to the unit’s Leadership characteristic it can Fall Back, otherwise it cannot Fall Back and must Remain Stationary instead.
- Each time an attack is made against this unit, if this unit has the INFANTRY keyword, an unmodified wound roll of 1-3 always fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making that attack may have.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditionGroups>
                        <conditionGroup type="and">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="c20e-53c7-af4c-ccbb" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                            <condition childId="f657-aa75-dcf2-df44" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </conditionGroup>
                        <conditionGroup type="and">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="f657-aa75-dcf2-df44" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1"/>
                            <condition childId="5f99-91de-58d7-182c" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
