    <profile name="Drop Pod Assault" id="3cbb-29df-49b3-f3d5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This transport must start the battle set up high in the skies.
- This transport can be set up in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules, and they must set up more than 6+D3&quot; away from any enemy models. 
- Any units embarked within this transport must immediately disembark after it has been set up on the battlefield, and they must be set up more than 6&quot; away from any enemy models, and within 3&quot; from the Transport.
- After this transport has been set up on the battlefield, no units can embark within it.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Psychic Hood" id="c357-e48d-b56c-96a5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit (or model) is targeted by an enemy psychic power and is within 12&quot; of a friendly model with a psychic hood, the wearer of the hood can attempt to Deny the Witch in their stead, as if he were in the target unit.  If the Deny the Witch attempt is failed, the psychic power is resolved as normal, but affects only the initial target, not the wearer of the hood.  If a model with a psychic hood is embarked in a vehicle or building, he can only use the hood to nullify powers targeting the vehicle or building he is embarked within.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Reliquarius" id="7d4b-f20b-b604-364b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model has a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Infernum halo-launcher" id="44b5-28cd-b395-cc43" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack made by an AIRCRAFT model is allocated to the bearer, add 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Reductor Pistol" id="1d26-5382-f4f2-ca7a" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
