        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Substract 1 from Psychic test rolls made by enemy units at 18&quot; range from any INFANTRY or BIKER models of ECLIPSE GUARD.
Add 1 to Psychic test rolls made by friendly ECLIPSE GUARD models at 18&quot;.</characteristic>
