            <selectionEntry name="Inquisition Agents - Ordo Malleus - Grey Knights" id="c01c-6741-ac91-8bfa" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="3f53-36cc-e79c-6072" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <infoGroups>
                <infoGroup name="Masters of the Warp" id="4882-5673-e3e7-6d14" hidden="false">
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name=" Masters of the Warp" id="c08b-7ecf-6632-6168" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">At the start of the first battle round, choose which of the Tides is currently dominant. The dominant Tide can subsequently be changed using the Warp Shaping Psychic power.
GREY KNIGHTS PSYKER units of your army gain a bonus depending on which Tide of the Warp is dominant for your army.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Tide of Convergence" id="2248-f290-1d43-9bee" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">- Add 6&quot; to the range characteristic of Psi weapons that models in this unit are equipped with.
- Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack with a Nemesis weapon, on an unmodified Wound roll of 6, the target suffers 1 mortal wound in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Tide of Celerity" id="0c8b-ac18-4a4b-ffbf" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">- Each time an Advance roll is made for this unit, treat a dice roll of 1-2 as 3 instead.
- Each time a Charge roll is made for this unit, treat each dice roll of 1-2 as 3 instead.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Tide of Banishment" id="babb-6229-cb4d-e271" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">- Each time a model in this unit makes an attack against a DAEMON unit, re-roll the Hit roll and re-roll a Wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Tide of Escalation" id="596d-d23b-1a6b-e11b" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">While this Tide is dominant for your army, each time a unit is selected to manifest Psychic powers, it can attempt to manifest the Psychic powers it knows at it&apos;s base Warp charge.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Tide of Shadows" id="ba0c-0cad-6cfe-ad11" hidden="false" typeId="3f84-e84f-ce38-2a3a" typeName="Tides of the Warp">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="8f5d-f870-d4dd-5393">While this Tide is dominant for your army, enemy models cannot target a model in this unit with ranged attacks unless they are within 24&quot; of it.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </infoGroup>
              </infoGroups>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink name="Authority of the Inquisition" id="ca17-d85a-8f4f-f02c" hidden="false" targetId="ae43-91bd-1487-7974" type="rule"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <modifiers>
