          <comment>2e33-41b1-0ca6-a3f3</comment>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly CHAPTER INFANTRY or CHAPTER BIKER unit is within 3&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6; on a 6, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="While a friendly &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY or &lt;CHAPTER&gt; BIKER unit is within 3&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6; on a 5+, that wound is not lost.">
