                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one enemy unit visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, while a friendly DARK ANGELS RAVENWING CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that RAVENWING unit makes an attack, that enemy unit does not receive the benefits of cover to its saving throw against that attack.</characteristic>
