          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 40 &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY models. 
Each JUMP PACK, GRAVIS or TERMINATOR model takes the space of two other models and each CENTURION model takes the space of three other models.
It can transport up to 2 DREADNOUGHT models, which each take up the space of 10 models. Cannot transport LEVIATHAN, DEREDEO or REDEMPTOR dreadnought models.</characteristic>
