                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, the first time a saving throw is failed for the bearer&apos;s unit, the Damage charactertistic of that attack is changed to 0</characteristic>
