                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer&apos;s unit is always considered to be within range of the following aura abilities of any friendly &lt;CHAPTER&gt; PHOBOS units that are on the battelfield; Rites of Battle, Tactical Precision.</characteristic>
