                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this litany is inspiring, then while a friendly GREY KNIGHTS CORE or GREY KNIGHTS CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this PRIEST, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
