                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your opponent’s Psychic phase, after a Psychic test is passed for an enemy PSYKER unit and after any Deny the Witch attempt is made. If that enemy PSYKER unit is within 24&quot; of any BLACK TEMPLARS units from your army, roll one D6: on a 4+, that psychic power is denied.</characteristic>
