                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in any phase, when an IMPERIAL FISTS INFANTRY or BIKER unit from your army is chosen as the target of an enemy attack. 
Until the end of that phase, when a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6; on a 4+ that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
