                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- After this WARLORD finishes a Charge move, roll one D6 for each enemy model that is within Engagement range of it; on a 5+ that model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
