                    <profile name="Absolute focus [Aura]" id="acb1-f83d-9470-9b47" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 6&quot; to the casting range of psychic powers for this warlord, aura type powers increase it&apos;s range by 3&quot;.
- If this WARLORD has not the PSYKER keyword, ECLIPSE GUARD units at 9&quot; of this WARLORD can re-roll morale tests.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="TL: 2. Warp currents Watcher" id="aed5-f13d-0f47-503e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="db30-4926-bfac-3f70" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="305b-1ad1-f42a-4445" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Warp currents Watcher [Aura]" id="0b32-0f42-cda6-bbb2" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- During the Psychic phase, each time a ECLIPSE GUARD INFANTRY model at 9&quot; of this WARLORD loses a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 1 to any Deny the Witch test taken by this WARLORD. If this WARLORD does not have the PSYKER keyword, in your opponent’s Psychic phase, this WARLORD can attempt to Deny the Witch once as if it were a PSYKER model.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                      <modifiers>
                        <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="a1be-ee90-b5b3-388d" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </modifier>
                      </modifiers>
                    </profile>
                    <profile name="Warp currents Watcher [Aura]" id="c1e8-32f8-b1c5-d95d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- During the Psychic phase, each time a DEATHWATCH INFANTRY model at 9&quot; of this WARLORD loses a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 1 to any Deny the Witch test taken by this WARLORD. If this WARLORD does not have the PSYKER keyword, in your opponent’s Psychic phase, this WARLORD can attempt to Deny the Witch once as if it were a PSYKER model.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                      <modifiers>
                        <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="ad68-c80e-d058-88b7" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </modifier>
                      </modifiers>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="TL: 3. Will suppressor" id="7605-9b75-2829-5d0b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="a5de-1515-4d06-b87e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="ffe5-968c-0d6b-bf60" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Will Suppressor [Aura]" id="f29f-caa1-3b15-0da0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, each time this WARLORD is selected to Deny the witch, it can roll an additional D6, and discard the one with the lowest result.
- If this WARLORD has not the PSYKER keyword, enemy units within 9&quot; of this WARLORD add 1 to Atrittion test rolls.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
