                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Command phase, select one enemy CHARACTER at 12&quot; and visible to this WARLORD, then roll a D6, on a 2-4, until your next Command phase, one of it&apos;s Aura abilities will have a range of 1&quot;; on a 5+, until your next Command phase, all of it&apos;s Aura abilities will have a range of 1&quot;.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
