                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During your opponent’s Psychic phase, this WARLORD can attempt to resist one additional psychic power, even if it is not a PSYKER and even if it is not within 24&quot; of the enemy model manifesting that psychic power. When taking that Deny the Witch test, do not roll the dice; it is automatically passed</characteristic>
