                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack is made against this WARLORD, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails. Substract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
