                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, if your army is Battle-forged and this WARLORD is on the Battlefield, roll one D6, on a 5+  you gain D3 Command Points.</characteristic>
