                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one friendly IRON HANDS unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD. Select a ranged weapon one of that unit&apos;s models have equipped. When resolving the attacks made with that weapon, you can re-roll the Hit roll, Wound roll and Damage roll.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
