                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This WARLORD can attempt to resist one Psychic power in your opponent’s Psychic phase by taking a Deny the Witch test. 
- If this WARLORD is a PSYKER, they instead can attempt to deny two additional Psychic powers in your opponent’s Psychic phase.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="IH: 1. Adept of the Omnissiah" id="efa6-71cc-1047-443e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="af56-ca4e-d09e-4923" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="1338-1daf-1f6f-146e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Adept of the Omnissiah" id="641f-d4ae-ef2f-483f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- At the end of your Movement phase, unless this WARLORD is a TECHMARINE, it can repar one friendly IRON HANDS VEHICLE model within 1&quot; of it. That VEHICLE model regains 1 lost wound. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.
- If this WARLORD is a TECHMARINE, then each time it uses its Blessing of the Omnissiah ability, the model it is repairing regains up to D3+2 lost wounds instead of D3.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="IH: 4. Student of History" id="9f78-f0ce-cac2-9579" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="0a4c-405c-a38b-0162" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                    <constraint id="8370-d612-b7e3-da3f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Student of History" id="5bb5-0038-d0da-2e88" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this WARLORD consolidates, they can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;, and do not have to end this move closer to the nearest enemy model</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
