                        <characteristic name="When the Deed is achieved, the Saga is active." typeId="dd67-afc0-b97e-9bd5">While a friendly SPACE WOLVES CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
