                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst this WARLORD is on the battlefield, you can roll one D6 for each Command Point you spend to use a Stratagem; on a 5+ that Command Point is refunded.</characteristic>
