                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one friendly ULTRAMARINES unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD. Until the start of your next Command phase, the Tactical Doctrine is active for that unit.</characteristic>
