                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- While a friendly DEATHWATCH CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, you can re-roll Morale tests taken for that unit.
- In your Command phase, you can select one friendly DEATHWATCH CORE unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit gains the Objective Secured ability. If a model in that unit already has this ability, that model counts as if were with one additional wound when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
