- If this WARLORD has made a charge move this turn, then until the end of the turn, each time a friendly GREY KNIGHTS CORE unit declares a charge against an enemy unit that is within Engagement Range of this WARLORD, add 1 to the charge roll made for that unit.</characteristic>
