                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s Wound roll.</characteristic>
