                        <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Psychic action: Rites of protection has a Warp charge value of 5. If manifested, select one friendly SWORDBEARERS VEHICLE model within 12&quot; of this WARLORD. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that model has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
