                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, in your shooting phase, after shooting with a &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, that unit can make a Normal Move. 
If it does, that unit is not eligible to delcare a charge with this turn.</characteristic>
