                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Shield of Sanguinius has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select a friendly BLOOD ANGELS unit within 12&quot; of the PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that unit has a 4+ Invulnerable save.</characteristic>
