                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Unleash Rage has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select a friendly BLOOD ANGELS unit within 12&quot; of the PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit make a melee attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
