                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Mind Worm has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER.
• That unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
• Until the start of your next Psychic phase, in the Fight phase, that unit is not eligible to fight until all other eligible units from your army have done so.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
