                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Gate of Infinity has a Warp charge value of 7. If manifested, selected one friendly GREY KNIGHTS PSYKER unit within 18&quot; of this Psyker. Remove that unit from the battlefield and then set it back up on the battlefield, anywhere that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
