                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Empyric Amplification has a Warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; and visible to this Psyker. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time an attack made with a Nemesis or psi weapon is allocated to a model in that unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristics of that attack</characteristic>
