                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Warp Charge" typeId="5ffd-b800-c317-532a">6</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">12&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Purge Soul has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER that has not already been selected for this power this phase. Then roll one D6 and add this PSYKER&apos;s unit Leadership characteristic to the result. Your opponent then rolls one D6 and add that units Leadership characteristic to the result.
- If your total is higher than your opponent&apos;s, the select unitl suffers D3 mortal wounds
