                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Hammerhand has a Warp charge value of 5. If manifested, until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in this PSYKER&apos;s unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</characteristic>
