                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Wrack and Ruin has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select either one BUILDING unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER, or select one enemy unit that is within a terrain feature, and is within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Roll nine D6, adding 1 to the result if the unit you selected was a BUILDING; for each roll of 4+ that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
