                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Enveloping Darkness has a Warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that unit cannot fire Overwatch, and when resolving an attack made by that unit, subtract 1 from the hit roll.</characteristic>
