                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Flaming Blast has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one point on the Battlefield within 24&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Roll 3D6 for each enemy unit within 3&quot; of that point; on a 4+ that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
