                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Burning Hands has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, then until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time this PSYKER makes a melee attack, you can select for it to use the close combat weapon profile (see the Warhammer 40,000 Core Book) instead of a melee weapon it is equipped with. Each time this Psyker makes an attack with the close combat weapon profile, if a hit is scored, the target suffers a mortal wound and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
