                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">6&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing (Aura): Storm Caller has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, until the start of your next Psychic phase, while their unit is within 6&quot; of this PSYKER, friendly SPACE WOLVES models receive the benefit of light cover.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
