                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Tempest’s Wrath has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select a one enemy unit within 24&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
