                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Precognition has a Warp charge value of 7. If manifested, then until the start of your next Psychic phase this PSYKER has a 3+ Invulnerable save and, when resolving an attack made against this psyker, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
