                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Blasting Gale has a Warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that unit cannot Advance, and when a charge roll is made for it, roll one fewer D6, to a minimum of one D6 (typically, this will mean one D6 is rolled instead of 2D6).</characteristic>
