                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Premorphic Resonance has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one friendly DEATHWATCH unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase:
- Any Overwatch attacks made by that unit score hits on rolls of 4+.
- If that unit starts the Fight phase within Engagement Range of any enemy models, it can fight first in that phase.
- Each time a melee attack is made by a model in that unit, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
