- Until the start of your next Psychic phase, reduce the range of that unit&apos;s aura abilities by 3&quot; (if the result of the Psychic test was greater than that CHARACTER unit&apos;s Leadership characteristic, then until the start of your next Psychic phase, enemy units cannot benefit from that unit&apos;s aura abilities).</characteristic>
