            <profile name="Crux Argenteum" id="7d48-62fe-66c1-efce" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This Character can perform a Heroic Intervention if there are any enemy units within 6&quot; of them instead of 3&quot;, and when doing so can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Cognis Teleport Beacon" id="5ae7-e9bc-6af2-961c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this unit advances, it can teleport. When teleporting, instead roll a D6, add 4&quot; to the movement, and ignore other units, scenography objects and terrain features. It can&apos;t end this movement in the Engagement Range of any enemy unit.
When this unit make a charge movement, enemy units can&apos;t fire overwatch against this unit, and it ignores terrain movement penalties.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Vengeful Past" id="cb83-f26c-03b4-213f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, you can include this Character unit in one TWILIGHT LURKER Detachment. 
The inclusion of this Character unit does not prevent other units from their Detachment from benefiting from Detachment abilities, and it does not prevent other units from your army benefiting from abilities that require every model in your army to have that ability.
This Character unit does not benefit from Detachment abilities, except the TWILIGHT LURKER &quot;Wardens against the warp&quot; trait.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
