            <profile name="Into the jaws" id="87d9-358c-3b7c-0dfd" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit successfully charges, for each unit that were target of that charge roll a D6, in a 3+ it suffers 1D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="No escape" id="f584-6a84-21f1-4b4c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the oponent movement phase, if a enemy unit within engagement range of this unit falls back, at the end of that phase this unit can move it&apos;s normal move distance, but must finish the move within engagement range of one of the enemy units which have fell back this turn from this unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
