              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly WHITE SCARS CORE or WHITE SCARS CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, if its unit made a charge move or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
