              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this model is chosen to shoot with in your Shooting phase, you can select one enemy unit that is not a VEHICLE and is within 12&quot; of this model. Roll one D6; on a 4+ that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
