              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model is included in your Crusade army, it automatically gains the Master of the Arsenal Honorific, even though it cannot normally gain any Battle Honours. This does not increase its Crusade points.</characteristic>
