            <profile name="Supreme Grand Master" id="86b6-40d8-619b-98f6" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly GREY KNIGHTS CORE or GREY KNIGHTS CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
