                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 3&quot; to the range of the bearer’s aura abilities (to a maximum of 9&quot;).
- In your Command phase, select one friendly BLACK TEMPLARS CORE unit and is within 9&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, the Assault Doctrine is considered to be active for that attack instead of the currently active combat doctrine.</characteristic>
