                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of either player&apos;s Command phase,  the bearer can unveil the Aurillian Shroud. If if does, until the start of your next Command phase, the bearer has the following ability: The Aurillian Shroud [Aura].</characteristic>
