                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model from your army with this Relic can be chosen to charge with even if they Advanced this turn.
When a charge roll is made for that model, you can re-roll the dice. 
In addition, after that model finishes a charge move, you can select one enemy unit within 1&quot; of that model and roll one D6; on a 4+ that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
