                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, in your Psychic phase, after resolving the efects of a psychic power from the Tempestas discipline that was successfully manifested by the bearer, roll one D6 for each enemy unit within 12&quot; of the bearer; on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
