                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly ULTRAMARINES CORE unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
