                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack with an Armour Penetration characteristic of -1 or -2  is allocated to the bearer, that attack as an Armour Penetration value of 0 instead. 
