                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a model with this Relic fights, it can make 1 additional attack with the close combat weapon profile. When resolving that attack, if a hit is scored the target suffers 1 mortal wound and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
