- While a friendly &lt;CHAPTER&gt; CORE or &lt;CHAPTER&gt; CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time a model in that unit makes an attack against the enemy unit you selected at the start of the first battle round, you can re-roll that attack’s hit roll and you can re-roll that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
