                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- When you give a model this Relic, select one bolt weapon that model is equipped with. 
- When the bearer shoots with that weapon, you can choose for it to fire a stormwrath bolt. If you do, the weapon has a Strength characteristic of 7 and an Armour Penetration characteristic of -1 for that attack. 
If the target of that attack is a MONSTER, the weapon has a Damage characteristic of D6 for that attack.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
