                <profile name="Frost weapon" id="2d39-78f3-4059-8a83" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- When you give a model this Relic, select one of the following weapons that model is equipped with: lightning claw; master-crafted power axe; master-crafted power sword; power axe; power sword.
- Add 1 to the Strength and Damage characteristic of that weapon (if the model is equipped with two lightning claws, improve the characteristics of both weapons). That weapon (or weapons, if the model is equipped with two lightning claws) is considered to be a Chapter Relic.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
