                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="3279-0878-4777-b0cb">If this Litany is inspiring, select one friendly CHAPTER CORE or CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this PRIEST. Each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack against the closest eligible target, add 1 to that attack&apos;s Wound roll.</characteristic>
