              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="3279-0878-4777-b0cb">If this Litany is inspiring, select one friendly BLACK TEMPLARS CORE unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST. Each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified Wound roll of 6 inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
