            <profile name="Plea of deliverance" id="4654-aa82-0e6f-9450" hidden="false" typeId="2489-961a-f4fc-d026" typeName="Litany">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="3279-0878-4777-b0cb">If this Litany is inspiring, select one friendly BLACK TEMPLARS CORE or BLACK TEMPLARS CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST.
- If that unit or its models are being affected by any psychic powers manifested by enemy models, the effects of those Psychic powers on that unit and its models end.
- Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit, and the models it contains, are not affected by any Psychic power manifested by enemy units.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
