              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- After selecting a Battlefield Role for the purposes of the Xenos Hunters Chapter Tactic for your army, select one additional Battlefield Role. 
